N0191 /findings/4/review_resolution/corrected_scope/basis
"Reuse root-M08 corrected independent resolution."

N0192 /findings/4/review_resolution/corrected_scope/half
"Live HP>1 loses floor(current/2); first all reductions, then HP-item checks on still-live field members, then user recharge2/current move. HP1 stays1; all live HP1 locally fails."

N0193 /findings/4/review_resolution/corrected_scope/end
"Alive user and affected target at after-all-hits: lose round(currentHP/2), minimum1; MagicGuard/RockHead do not block; HP-item check follows."

N0194 /findings/4/review_resolution/corrected_scope/damage_registration
"Do not reinstate raw M08 no-damage-registration wording: the false argument disables animation, while damage registration retains its default true. Positive reduction sets the two round-damage flags and may set below-half flag at that moment; this does not guarantee every direct-hit record is populated or flags survive later cleanup. M04-003 already states this correctly."

N0195 /findings/4/review_resolution/corrected_scope/scope_exclusion
"ShadowSky and the separately conditional two-side four-screen clearer are broader M08-only coverage; optional SHADOWSHED unknown binding is M08-003, not an added claim here."

N0196 /findings/4/review_resolution/root_direct_source_reuse
"Root previously independently reviewed the exact added Half/End scope; no duplicate source reread credited to C04."

